        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You can identify this problem by having someone read your writing aloud. If that reader hesitates, stumbles over words, or runs out of breath before getting to the end of a sentence, so will someone reading it silently. You can revise in four ways: cut, turn dependent clauses into independent sentences, change clauses to modifying phrases, or coordinate.",
